# Changelog

  All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

  The format is based on Keep a Changelog.

  ## [Unreleased]

  ### Added

  - Shared VHDL package containing CHIP-8 constants, types, and opcode helpers.
  - CHIP-8 memory module with 4 KiB of addressable memory.
  - Zed tasks for VHDL checking and complete Game Bub builds.

  ### Changed

  - Organized the VHDL implementation into separate engine and memory modules.

  ### Fixed

  - Corrected VHDL source ordering so packages are analyzed before dependent modules.

  ## [0.0.2] - 2026-09-21

### Added

  - Shared VHDL package containing CHIP-8 constants, types, and opcode helpers.
  - CHIP-8 memory module with 4 KiB of addressable memory.
  - Zed tasks for VHDL checking and complete Game Bub builds.

### Added

- Game Bub host communication and core lifecycle handling.
- SystemVerilog wrapper for video, input, audio, and clock interfaces.
- VHDL CHIP-8 engine integration.
- 64 × 32 monochrome framebuffer.
- Scaled and centered framebuffer output.
- Framebuffer test pattern for hardware verification.
- CERN-OHL-W-2.0 license.

### Changed

- Replaced the original Pong example with the CHIP-8 core structure.
- Updated project metadata and build configuration for CHIP-8.

## [0.0.1] - 2026-09-20
